  "solution": "We apply each option to the given equation & solve it using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven: 4 - 10 ÷ 8 + 3 × 2 = 6\n\nOption 1) ×, +\n\n4 - __10 ÷ 8__ × 3 + 2 = 6\n\n4 - __1.25____ × 3__ + 2 = 6\n\n__4__ - 3.75 __+ 2__ = 6\n\n__6 - 3.75__ = 6\n\n2.25 ≠ 6\n\nGiven: 4 - 10 ÷ 8 + 3 × 2 = 6\n\nOption 2) ×, -\n\n4 × __10 ÷ 8__ + 3 - 2 = 6\n\n__4 × 1.25__ + 3 - 2 = 6\n\n__5 + 3__ - 2 = 6\n\n__8 - 2__ = 6\n\n6 = 6\n\nGiven: 4 - 10 ÷ 8 + 3 × 2 = 6\n\nOption 3) ÷, ×\n\n4 - 10 × 8 + __3 ÷ 2__ = 6\n\n4 - __10 × 8__ + 1.5 = 6\n\n__4__ - 80 __+ 1.5__ = 6\n\n__5.5 - 80__ = 6\n\n74.5 ≠ 6\n\nGiven: 4 - 10 ÷ 8 + 3 × 2 = 6\n\nOption 4) ÷, -\n\n__4 ÷ 10__ - 8 + 3 × 2 = 6\n\n0.4 - 8 + __3 × 2__ = 6\n\n__0.4__ - 8 __+ ____6__ = 6\n\n6.4 - 8 = 6\n\n-1.6 ≠ 6\n\nHence the correct answer is option 2)",
